{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-logarithm-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:q-logarithm-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the $q$-logarithm primitive","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-logarithm","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-exponential-exists"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-q-logarithm-exists"],"tags":["existence","q-logarithm","primitive","hopf-algebra"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QLogarithm.exists_in_shuffle_hopf","text":"q-logarithm-exists.md","leanSource":"q-logarithm-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"prop:q-logarithm-exists\"></a>\n<strong>Proposition.</strong> <em>Existence of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-logarithm primitive</em></p>\n<p>Under the hypotheses securing <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\exp_q</code>, there exists a unique primitive <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\log_q \\in \\mathrm{Prim}(\\mathcal{H}_q)</code> satisfying <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\log_q \\circ \\exp_q = \\mathrm{id}</code>.</p>\n"}
